WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.140
I wasn't being fair to you before.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.560
I'm sorry.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:15.560
I can't control my emotions
and blamed you for it.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.880
As I am right now, I can't be your girlfriend.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:58.880
You're going home?

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.890
In this rain?

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.860
What brought this on? You'll catch a cold!

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.940
I'm all right, really.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.490
I'll get the car, then.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.560
No.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.350
That's really not...

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:17.320
Kazusa, call Ogino-san.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.320
OK.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.390
Hey, Yacchan-

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:25.170
I'm fine, really.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:33.540
Umm... Seriously... I'm fine...

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.420
Umm...

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.260
I'll drive you home.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.910
Did you and Yasuko have a fight?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:04.350
It was probably just her saying things that hurt you.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:14.380
The advising professor to the Drama Club...

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.290
Was that who she was in love with?

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:22.420
Oh, right. You were at
Fujigaya for the play.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.100
Kagami-sensei is marrying
Kazusa, you know.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.170
Huh?

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:31.070
Kazusa-san... You mean he's
marrying your sister?

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.300
This September.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.080
OK, which way at the light?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:51.340
Good morning, Fumi-chan.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:58.230
So, did you have a good
time at Sempai's house?

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.760
Yeah.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.260
Did you meet the Four Sugimoto Sisters?

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.250
Yeah.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.780
The one who taught at our school, too?

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.070
Say, Achan.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.380
Wanna go see that today?

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.680
Nationwide Release - Real World

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.370
Good morning.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.400
Oh, Okudaira-san!

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.130
Check this out, it's big news!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.020
What is it?

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.750
You'll freak out when you see it.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.020
Ready, set...

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.450
Kagami-sensei Engaged!!

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.660
Gimme a break...

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.430
Hmm?

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.040
"Kagami-sensei Engaged"?

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.510
Whoops. Looks like someone
broke the scoop about you.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:47.500
Engaged to Ex-faculty Member,
Professor Kazusa Sugimoto

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.380
You know how girls are at this age.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:53.470
This sort of news travels fast.

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:55.040
Don't I know it?

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.770
From Matsuoka All-girls High School,
Yasuko Sugimoto-san.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.640
You're a liar.

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:36.920
You said you didn't know Sugimoto-sempai.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:40.590
Hey, why do you care so
much about Sugimo-

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.010
I'm in love with her.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.820
I'm in love with her. Is that strange to you?

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:51.220
Didn't she used to be in love with you?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.980
I dunno.

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:57.160
I mean, seeing her cry...

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:01.310
I... I knew she...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.600
I see.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:18.270
She was that deep in love with...

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.940
...her big sister's boyfriend.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.070
Hey, what's with you?

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:38.660
You've been acting strange
since this morning.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.920
Did you and Sempai get into a fight again?

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.480
She dumped me.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:46.300
Huh?

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.260
Oh, hi, Achan.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.900
Fumi's not here yet?

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:07.140
Fumi-chan isn't feeling well,
so she took the day off.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.400
You mad at me?

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:15.710
I'm not mad.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.340
Don't be so mad at me.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:28.980
Watazuka... Watazuka...

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.430
We're getting off.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.550
Hey! W-Wait!

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.670
There's a place I wanna check out.

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:37.380
Huh?

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.820
Here's the anmitsu dessert
with ice cream you ordered.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.290
Fumi never liked red bean paste, huh?

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:06.220
I used to always eat her
ohagi rice cakes for her.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:08.130
Yeah, she mentioned that.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:11.610
She was always talking about you, actually.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.710
Don't try and change the subject.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.760
Why did you dump Fumi-chan?

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.450
That's not what happened.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.770
And you're scary.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:28.950
Are you in love
with Kagami-sensei?

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:30.860
Yes.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.200
Are you still in love with him?

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:39.370
Everyone asks the same things.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:48.460
He was my sister's boyfriend
and I fell for him.

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.520
Then they finally got engaged...

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.130
I didn't think it'd hit me so hard.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.100
Coming!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:34.680
Oh. What's the matter, Achan?

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:35.820
You aren't at school?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.980
It's a half-day today.

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:43.080
I came to check on Fumi-chan.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.130
You're always welcome at our house.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.850
I'm coming in then!

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.000
Coming.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.890
I hate myself.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.820
A-Achan?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.430
You skipped school today, didn't you?

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.380
Huh?

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.260
Umm...

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:08.400
I did too.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:10.740
Huh? Why?

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.590
You won't be mad at me?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.960
Huh? Why would I be?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.260
I confronted Sempai.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:24.430
I mean, she was cruel and selfish.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.390
I couldn't let that go.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:36.010
Damn it, this is your guys' problem,
so why did I have to involve myself?!

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:43.210
You're too kind for your own sake.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.200
I wanna die.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.290
Seriously, don't worry about it.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.880
Thank you, Achan.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.710
Matsuoka All-girls High School

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.260
Summer vacation!

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:37.770
Huh?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.470
See, she's not listening.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:43.160
I said sum-mer va-ca-tion!

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.840
We're talking about maybe going
somewhere together.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.000
Oh, right...

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.060
Hey, hey.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.320
You think Achan will come if we ask?

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.220
Huh?

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.080
A summer home?!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.600
That's awesome!

00:12:57.600 --> 00:13:01.420
I go there every year with
Ko-chan and his family.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:05.900
I thought it'd be even more
fun if you came too.

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:08.450
What? Me? I don't know...

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:12.850
If you'd rather not go alone,
you can invite your friends.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.470
You know, those lively
girls from Matsuoka...

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:17.150
Oh, Pon-chan and the gang?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.300
Yep. Oh, also,

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.010
you can invite Manjome-san
too, if you want.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.970
I mean, I don't wanna twist anybody's arm,

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.390
but don't you think the more the merrier?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:30.380
Oh, I like it. What a swell idea!

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:33.110
Maybe this is what Fumi-chan
needs to cheer her back up!

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.760
No, I mean, umm...

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:41.810
Ah... Why do I always have
to run my big mouth?

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:44.310
Did something happen to Manjome-san?

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.550
If it's personal, you don't have to tell me.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.310
OK, well,

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:54.090
Fumi-chan and Sempai broke up.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.350
Yeah, you shouldn't have told me that.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:03.660
Maybe it'd be awkward if she sees me now.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.780
Umm, I'll run the idea by her, anyway.

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.440
Literary Club

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.990
Aren't you supposed to be focused
on your club activities?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.100
Make me some tea, if you're free.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.630
I'm not free.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.830
Then go join the others.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.330
All right.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.710
Hello again.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.990
Manjome-san, make me some tea, will ya?

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:39.550
I'll have the one with the
light-blue bear on it.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:40.720
Oh, sure.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.300
I'll have the one with the orange cat, then.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.230
Sounds good.

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:04.330
Long time no see.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:05.490
Yeah...

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:07.200
What is it?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.090
Right...

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:14.190
Umm, I heard you and Manjome-san
broke up...

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.360
Who told you that?

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.230
Wait, it must be Achan.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.650
She has a big mouth for a small girl.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:21.860
And?

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:25.620
Did you think I'd date you next?

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:33.360
Psych.

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.580
Sorry, forget that. See ya.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.760
I did think that.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:43.500
I did!

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:46.700
Gimme a break.

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:52.730
Sempai, it's summer vacation.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:53.920
Your point?

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:57.280
Can I come over for drawing lessons again?

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:00.970
You can come, but I won't be involved.

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.750
Are you in love with Kagami-sensei?

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:06.590
You need to learn how to
ease into a question.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:11.220
I think you're a dishonest person.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:13.240
Really now?

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:16.400
But I love you, Sempai.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.460
Nobody likes a pushy girl.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.710
Including you?

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.380
Don't make me hit you.

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:31.010
You might get off on unrequited love, but I-

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.390
That's not it at all!

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:36.690
Anyway, it annoys me when you
expect me to act a certain way.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.820
I apologize. I won't bring it up again.

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:44.770
So yeah,

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:47.620
I'll go ahead and let my sister know
you're coming for lessons.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.690
I'm really coming this time!

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:55.930
Kyoko-chan... Kyoko-chan...

00:16:56.610 --> 00:17:00.280
Oh, I remember her. What
was her last name again?

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:01.710
Ikumi.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:06.550
Oh yeah! She came once and
never showed up again.

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.760
Maybe I was a bad teacher.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:12.050
She just came to see me.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.330
Oh?

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:17.070
Did she stop coming because
she started disliking you?

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.600
It was because I turned her down.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.220
Aw, poor thing.

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:34.670
Kazusa-chan, you look masculine when you draw.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:36.290
And you dress manly, too.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:39.600
I do spread my legs out when I sit...

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:42.760
You look cool.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:45.620
Summer home?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:49.010
Right? Ikumi-san's so cool.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.790
You're allowed to say no.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.990
Huh? But don't you want to go, Achan?

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:03.110
I'm going with or without you,

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.050
so don't worry about me.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.890
So mean!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.060
Now you've done it!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:12.610
I'll go too.

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.480
You don't feel forced into it?

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:17.220
Nope.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:19.160
Really?

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.600
Really.

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.070
Don't make some weird

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:26.010
"We were rejected by Sugimoto-sempai"
club with Ikumi-san.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:27.990
Of course not! Geez!

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:33.160
I barely have feelings for her anymore.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.020
You're just putting on a tough front.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.390
It's not a tough front.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.890
Because the reason I'm feeling better...

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:51.020
The reason I felt I could get through this...

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.750
...is all thanks to you, Achan.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:06.200
Hon'atsugi-san and them are so excited.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.510
They're all gearing up to go!

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:10.560
Oh, that's great.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.690
Umm, the summer home...

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.250
It's in Kiyosato.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.650
Kiyosato... Is that in Yamanashi?

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:20.240
Oh, Yamanashi has awesome grapes,
peaches, and cherries...

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:22.960
I'm gonna eat till I explode!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.440
Geez, all you think about is food.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:27.540
Seriously.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:32.030
Achan has always been like this.

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.190
She gets all energetic once afternoon hits.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.390
Exactly.

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:36.370
Well then,

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:39.510
I'm gonna excuse myself, and yeah...
pick some flowers or something...

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.980
Okudaira-san loves to meddle, huh?

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:46.820
You said it.

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:01.660
Are you still in love with Sempai?

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.330
Huh? I...

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.070
Sorry, I didn't mean to ask
such a personal question.

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:15.450
Oh, no, I... I'm already...

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:19.780
Me... On top of being rejected, she
completely hates me now.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.740
And yet I still love her.
I'm a true idiot, huh?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.190
No...

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.290
You're not...

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:37.640
Maybe I do get off on unrequited love.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.190
That's not true.

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.800
Manjome-san?

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:44.300
Huh?

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:49.580
Huh? What?

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:51.970
Oh man. Sorry.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:07.820
Look at us!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:13.650
Love is Blind

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.870
See you next time.
